From eb3fef5af7a212ca2877cde4866d1ff7ade06b48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:42:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add redundant option to alerts/for check

Allow disabling reports about for and keep_firing_for fields set to
the default value via:

  check "alerts/for" {
    redundant = false
  }

Invalid values are still reported.

Fixes #1956.
